                             the card renders as a solid white block. -->
                        <Path Fill="White"
                              Data="F0 M6 6C3.79086 6 2 7.79086 2 10V22C2 24.2091 3.79086 26 6 26H26C28.2091 26 30 24.2091 30 22V10C30 7.79086 28.2091 6 26 6H6ZM26 8H6C4.89543 8 4 8.89542 4 10V12H28V10C28 8.89542 27.1046 8 26 8ZM4 22V14H28V22C28 23.1046 27.1046 24 26 24H6C4.89543 24 4 23.1046 4 22Z" />
